data: {"id": "c628dcebd40541de-final", "run_id": "c628dcebd40541de", "seq": 1106, "ts_ms": 1789144540441, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v10/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Deployment 配置缺失关键环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `Pod phase: Running` | 确认 Pod 存活且未被调度系统驱逐 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason: Error` (exit code: 78) | 证实容器在上一轮运行中发生异常退出 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.restart_count: 19` | 印证 CrashLoopBackOff 的持续性振荡现象 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `resource_request/memory: 8Mi`, `resource_limit/memory: 32Mi` | 确认内存配置并非导致 OOM 的根本原因 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `\"APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing\"` | 提供终止的直接语义原因 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `reason: CrashLoopBackOff (1)`, `reason: Error (1)` | 独立观测到 CrashLoopBackOff 事件与 Error 退出状态 |\n\n**证据印证：**\n*   Pod 状态为 `Running` (fact 1) 配合高重启次数 (fact 3) 及 `last_terminated_reason: Error` (fact 2)，在逻辑上排除了 Pod 崩溃无法启动或长期处于 `Terminating` 的可能，精准指向“启动即报错退出”的场景。\n*   Elasticsearch 日志直接报告了环境变量缺失 (fact 5)，而 K8s 资源配置显示内存充足 (fact 4)，从而排除了资源超限引发的异常退出。\n*   Metric 维度独立确认了 CrashLoopBackOff (fact 6)，与 K8s 事件状态（如 `BackOff` 警告）相互交叉验证，确保了现象的真实性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nDeployment 配置缺失关键环境变量 APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG → 应用启动失败 (Exit Code 78) → 容器频繁重启形成 CrashLoopBackOff → 用户无法正常使用该应用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Deployment 配置缺失关键环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`**。\n*   **事实支撑**：Elasticsearch 日志直接指出该变量缺失 (fact 5)；K8s 容器状态显示应用以错误码 78 退出 (fact 2)，并在 76 分钟内重启了 19 次，导致集群报告了 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 (fact 1, 3, 6)。\n*   **排除假设**：容器重启未触发 OOMKill（`last_terminated_reason` 为 Error 而非 OOMKilled），且内存限制（32Mi）与请求（8Mi）远高于应用正常启动所需的最低开销，证实内存非根因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 55.1s\n├─ 问题定位: 20.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 25.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v10/workload: 25.7s (Evidence 20.8s, RCA 4.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v10/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 55.102, "metrics": {"run_id": "c628dcebd40541de", "mttr": {"value": "55.1s", "seconds": 55.10891008377075, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 55108.91008377075, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 52182.69062042236, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6810.707092285156, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2622.8902339935303}, "nodes": {"l